      "extract": "arXiv:2007.13108v1 [math.PR] 26 Jul 2020 Log concavity and concentration of Lipschitz functions on the Boolean hypercube Ronen Eldan∗and Omer Shamir† July 28, 2020 Abstract It is well-known that measures whose density is the form e−V where V is a uniformly convex potential on Rn attain strong concentration properties. In search of a notion of log-concavity on the discrete hypercube, we consider measures on {−1, 1}n",
